the GSB was working through like a racial
equity task force that I participated in.

00:47:17.500 --> 00:47:22.289
That basically, brought together alumni
from across many different generations to

00:47:22.289 --> 00:47:26.607
talk about a lot of these issues that were
top of mind for students and alums and

00:47:26.607 --> 00:47:28.151
the rest of our community.

00:47:28.151 --> 00:47:29.257
And basically,

00:47:29.257 --> 00:47:34.001
with the intention of figuring out
what actions the GSB needed to take.

00:47:34.001 --> 00:47:37.065
To my knowledge, I haven't heard
of other programs doing that or

00:47:37.065 --> 00:47:38.522
having similar initiatives.

00:47:38.522 --> 00:47:42.950
So I think to me, that kind of speaks
volumes of what the GSB is willing to do,

00:47:42.950 --> 00:47:46.895
at least in terms of listening to
start considering kind of plans for

00:47:46.895 --> 00:47:48.300
improving diversity.

